| cumulative |                          | 1970-01-01T00:03:00 | 0.16666666666666666                                      |
| delta      | delta                    | 1970-01-01T00:03:00 | 0.25                                                     |
| single     | delta                    | 1970-01-01T00:03:00 | 0.03888888888888889                                      |
+------------+--------------------------+---------------------+----------------------------------------------------------+

-- SQLNESS SORT_RESULT 3 1
TQL EVAL (180, 180, '1m') sum by (series) (rate(delta_temporality[3m]));

